 This package repackages the proprietary NVIDIA Accelerated Linux Graphics
 Driver, version 390.157, as a reproducible build. The driver binaries are
 NOT free software. They are redistributed under the "License For Customer Use
 of NVIDIA Software" (reproduced below).
